sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student
    participant Ctrl as ReservationController (Calin)
    participant Res as ReservationService (Calin)
    participant Sec as CurrentUser (Stefania)
    participant Clk as Clock (Calin)
    participant Cat as CatalogApi (Liviu)
    participant Repo as ReservationRepository (Calin)
    participant Audit as AuditService (Liviu)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 18

    User->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/reservations (assetId, startTime, endTime)
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Res: createReservation(request)
    activate Res

    Note over Res: @Transactional method begins

    Res->>Sec: currentUser.id()
    Sec-->>Res: userId

    Res->>Clk: LocalDateTime.now(clock)
    Clk-->>Res: current Bucharest time

    Note over Res: Validate slot invariants:<br/>- 08:00 to 20:00 opening hours<br/>- :00 or :30 alignment<br/>- 30 min to 4 hour duration<br/>- within 14 days, future time

    Note over Res: 1. Pessimistic Row Locking to prevent double bookings
    Res->>Cat: lockForBooking(assetId)
    activate Cat
    Cat->>DB: SELECT * FROM assets WHERE id = :id FOR UPDATE
    Note over DB: Acquires row-level FOR UPDATE lock.<br/>Concurrent bookings on same asset wait here.
    DB-->>Cat: Asset
    Cat-->>Res: void
    deactivate Cat

    Note over Res: 2. Operational Status Check
    Res->>Cat: isBookable(assetId)
    activate Cat
    Cat-->>Res: boolean isBookable
    deactivate Cat
    alt Asset not operational
        Res-->>Ctrl: 409 Conflict (ASSET_NOT_BOOKABLE)
    end

    Note over Res: 3. Temporal Overlap Collision Check
    Res->>Repo: existsOverlap(assetId, start, end, ACTIVE_STATUSES, -1)
    activate Repo
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM reservations WHERE asset_id = :id<br/>AND status IN ('CONFIRMED', 'CHECKED_OUT', 'OVERDUE')<br/>AND start_time < :end AND end_time > :start
    DB-->>Repo: overlapping rows
    Repo-->>Res: boolean exists
    deactivate Repo

    alt Overlap exists
        Res-->>Ctrl: 409 Conflict (RESERVATION_CONFLICT)
    end

    alt Not admin (!currentUser.isAdmin())
        Note over Res: 4. Student Active Quota Advisory Lock
        Res->>Repo: lockUserQuota(userId)
        activate Repo
        Repo->>DB: SELECT pg_advisory_xact_lock(1, CAST(:userId AS integer))
        DB-->>Repo: count
        Repo-->>Res: 1
        deactivate Repo

        Res->>Repo: countByUserIdAndStatusIn(userId, ACTIVE_STATUSES)
        activate Repo
        Repo->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM reservations WHERE user_id = :id<br/>AND status IN ('CONFIRMED', 'CHECKED_OUT', 'OVERDUE')
        DB-->>Repo: count
        Repo-->>Res: count
        deactivate Repo

        alt count >= 2
            Res-->>Ctrl: 409 Conflict (RESERVATION_LIMIT_REACHED)
        end
    end

    Res->>Repo: save(Reservation[status=CONFIRMED, assetId, userId, start, end])
    activate Repo
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO reservations (...)
    DB-->>Repo: persisted row
    Repo-->>Res: Reservation
    deactivate Repo

    Res->>Audit: record(userId, "CREATE_RESERVATION", "Reservation", saved.id, "Asset " + assetId)
    activate Audit
    Audit-->>Res: void
    deactivate Audit

    Note over Res,DB: Transaction commits, releasing PostgreSQL row and advisory locks

    Res-->>Ctrl: ReservationResponse
    deactivate Res
    Ctrl-->>User: 201 Created (ReservationResponse JSON)
    deactivate Ctrl
